sh at Y 255\n* Fixed structures location in world\n* Fixed Infected Water fluid conflict with Extra Planets mod\n* Fixed snowball not dropped from snow layer\n* Fixed Shield Generator inventory issue\n* Fixed Vein Floater boss fight music\n* Fixed Zergius causes world corruption. Closes #30\n* Fixed Custom Boss Bar not rendered\n* Removed Metadata from blocks/items\n* Removed Tiered Rocket\n* Removed Rocket Crusher",
        "2.1.1": "* Optimized Shield rendering\n* Fixed Server Side crash\n* Fixed required library issue\n* Fixed Dark Energy Generator rotation\n* Fixed Shield Generator Inventory GUI offset\n* Fixed Shield Generator item duplication\n* Remove Space Capsule",
        "2.1.10": "* Fixed critical issue with Diona Dungeon Spawner",
        "2.1.11": "* Added Disable Ore Gen config, Implemented #76 \n* Added Abandoned Satellite on Diona \n* Added Desh Frame \n* Added Alien Ship Decoration Stairs \n* Added structures to locate command \n* Added a bit world color to Chalos and Koentus \n* Added Japanese language\n* Required Galacticraft build 251\n* Update korean language\n* Recreate Crashed Alien Ship, add more parts\n* Cheese Spore Flower can be grow with bone meal\n* Reduce Gravity Harvester world generation rate\n* Prevent Cheese Spore Flower from world gen grow into the tree\n* Alien Ship Booster can be place in all direction\n* Better Shield Generator entity checking handler\n* Reduce Cheese Spore tree generation\n* Fixed minor issue with Cheese Spore world generation\n* Fixed stairs model\n* Fixed Shield Generator GUI position\n* Fixed capsule not consumed, closed #80\n* Fixed server crashed when placing Nuclear Waste Generator or Dark Energy Receiver, closed #81",
        "2.1.12": "* Fixed Black Hole crashed server\n* Fixed check liquid method inside client class",
        "2.1.13": "* Added Shield Generator recipe, Closed #65 \n* Added \"Enable Nibiru Infected Spore suffocation for mobs\" config, Implemented #82\n* Now Required SteveKunG's Lib 1.1.7\n* GC Dungeon Locator should get correct MP Dungeon location\n* Renamed Ore Gen configs\n* Minor fix to Shield Generator screen size\n* Fixed crash when right click machines with battery\n* Fixed Nibiru Dungeon failed to generated\n* Fixed performance issue with LivingUpdate/WeatherTick events, Closed #95\n* Removed Saturation Effect from Cheese Milk Fluid, Closed #83",
        "2.1.14": "* Required SteveKunG's Lib 1.1.9\n* Attempt to fix crash with spongeforge\n* Removed Invalid Fingerprint check",
        "2.1.2": "* Fixed crash when JEI not installed\n* Fixed rare crash with Infected Crystallized potion overlay",
        "2.1.3": "* Added Slab to Block recipes \n* Added Black Hole/Ion Cannon schematics to Tier 4 Loot \n* Added Space Portal multi-layer model support\n* Update Latest GC API. Closes #33\n* New Black Hole gravity behavior\n* Renamed \"Infected Crystallized Web\" to \"Infected Crystallized Cobweb\"\n* Renamed \"Large Infected Crystallized\" to \"Infected Crystallized Crystal\"\n* Shield Generator its \"shield\" now should rendered properly\n* Only enable Space Portal recipe when enabled survival planet config\n* Space Portal now require to stand on the block\n* Prevent Milk from cure capsule effect\n* Minor performance improved\n* Optimize JEI recipes\n* Improved Black Hole Storage schematic\n* Fixed Grass color in space biomes\n* Fixed Black Hole not spawning falling block\n* Fixed Sealable Waste Rod model\n* Fixed invisible item models (Forge build 2725)\n* Fixed Black Hole Storage schematic valid item slot\n* Fixed Infected Spore Protection potion duration time",
        "2.1.4": "* Added Fuel for item doors \n* Added Korean Language \n* Re-added Gravity Boots\n* Now required SteveKunG's Lib 1.0.3\n* Support Planet Progression\n* Reduce giant worm spawning\n* Fixed server crash with Portal sound. Closes #40\n* Fixed WorldTickEvent performance issue. Closes #47\n* Fixed JEI Recipe for Dark Energy Transform\n* Fixed Black Hole entity data and reduce falling block lag",
