        "2.1.6": "* Added Space Portal Camera Effect\n* Update Forge version\n* Update SteveKunG's Lib to 1.1.0\n* Attempt to fix crash with Space Warper Core. Fixes #58\n* Fixed Infected Crystallized first person overlay rendering\n* Fixed raining particle on Nibiru\n* Remove Left Click hack for Fire block",
        "2.1.7": "* Update New GC Inventory system\n* Required GC Build 215",
        "2.1.8": "* Required GC Build 219\n* Required SteveKunG's Lib 1.1.2\n* Minor change to Cheese Spore Hut\n* Performance Improvement\n* Better Fog rendering with glowing layers on entities\n* Improved Cheese Floater slime particle when hurt\n* Improved Energy Transfer for Sealable Nuclear Waste Rod\n* Fixed Energy display for Space Warp Pad (Waila)\n* Fixed items in tile entities not saved\n* Fixed Energy Storage not stored their tier data\n* Fixed world being null in Custom Spawning Handler\n* Fixed rare crash with Custom Boss Bar\n* Fixed Weather on Nibiru not working with Vein Floater\n* Fixed Nibiru Sky rendering\n* Fixed crystals block lighting",
        "2.1.9": "* Added DRY Biome type to Infected Badlands biome\n* Dungeon Entrance improvements\n* More random brightness to glowing texture\n* Better Infected Purlonite overlay rendering on entity\n* SoundEvents should be registered properly on server side\n* Renamed all blocks/items/entities \"Infected Crystallized\" to \"Infected Purlonite\"\n* Fixed random crash with NullPointerException\n* Fixed Zelius Egg dropped by explosion\n* Fixed Charged Zelius Creeper rendering\n* Fixed rare race condition with sided config machine",
        "2.2.0": "* A Dog House \n* Re-Added Fronos Planet \n* Added a New Texture for Fronos Planet \n* Added New Blocks (Fronos Grass, Fronos Tall Grass, Fronos Fern, Fronos Lily Pad, Fronos Mushroom, Pink Blechnum, Nemophila, Large Wheat, Purple Bush) \n* Added New Logs/Planks/Trees/Saplings/Doors/Trapdoors (Oscalea, Frolia) \n* Added 4 Fronos Biomes (Meadow, Plains, River, Forest) \n* Added Blue Pear\n* World Environment color is now working, Chalos render more yellowish and Koentus render more bluish\n* Marshmallow sitting now plays cloth sound\n* Blue Pear now used to tempt Fronos Creatures\n* Wheat now used to breed Fronos Creatures\n* Some minor fixes to Fronos Creatures facial animation/texture\n* Fixed crash when trying render Infected Purlonite effect, Compatibility with JustEnoughResources. Closed #99\n* Fixed locale issues\n* Fixed some slab blocks not burning\n* Fixed breaking particle for Fronos Grass Block\n* Removed condition from 'space_portal' recipe",
